   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Parts of an email address",
     "texto": [
      "**Endereço de correio eletrónico** (or the short form **e-mail**) is the email address.",
      "The symbol **@** is called **arroba** (pronounced /ah-RROH-buh/).",
      "The symbol **.** is called **ponto**.",
      "Portugal's domain ends in **.pt** (read /PONG-too peh-TEH/).",
      "When you register, you will always be asked to confirm the details before clicking **enviar**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
